# The app parses rules/*.md with line-oriented regexes; a CRLF checkout leaves
# a stray \r that makes markdown tables invisible to the parser. Keep every
# text file LF in the working tree regardless of platform, so a Windows clone
# behaves the same as GitHub Pages and raw.githubusercontent, and so the
# desktop build bundles LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets - never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.psd binary
*.svg text eol=lf
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
